This directory vendors the source of @gotgenes/pi-subagents
(https://github.com/gotgenes/pi-packages/tree/main/packages/pi-subagents),
an MIT-licensed hard fork of tintinweb/pi-subagents.

Vendored into pi-pack and adapted to its conventions:

  - the upstream `src/` tree was flattened into this extension directory
  - `#src/*` import aliases were rewritten to relative `.ts` imports
  - operational settings moved from `subagents.json` into the shared
    `~/.pi/couralabs/settings.json` file under the `subagents` key
  - custom agents are read from `<cwd>/.agents/agents/*.md` and
    `~/.agents/agents/*.md`
  - the `subagents:settings` command was briefly renamed to a `couralabs`
    prefixed form, then the old `couralabs` command prefix was dropped again
    from every pi-pack command (`/subagents`, `/subagents:settings`,
    `/prompt-ui`, `/footer-ui`, `/messages-ui`). The thinking toggle is
    `/thinking-ui` rather than `/thinking`, because pi's built-in `/thinking`
    ("Set thinking level") wins in interactive mode and cannot be shadowed.
  - the built-in `Plan` agent was removed; the embedded default agents are
    `general-purpose`, `plan-reviewer`, `Arquitect`, `Code-Review`, and
    `Explore`
  - the `pi.extensions` manifest entry is provided by pi-pack

The upstream MIT license is preserved in LICENSE.
